--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data: ExifTool tag metadata
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This distribution includes tag metadata generated by Image::ExifTool 13.55:

  crates/etng-tags/data/listx.xml   — verbatim output of `exiftool -listx -f`
  crates/etng-tags/data/tags.tsv    — a transformed subset of that output
                                      (groups, table, id, name, type,
                                      writable flag, print-conversion pairs)

Image::ExifTool is Copyright (c) 2003-2026 Phil Harvey and is distributed
under the same terms as Perl itself (either the Perl Artistic License or the
GNU General Public License). This project uses the Artistic License option;
the full text is in LICENSES/Artistic-1.0-Perl.txt.

The files above are unmodified/generated data, not ExifTool source code. They
are redistributed under Artistic-1.0-Perl and are NOT covered by this
project's MIT license. The generator and all executable code remain MIT.

To rebuild or refresh the data from your own ExifTool installation:

  cargo xtask update-tags      # writes crates/etng-tags/data/listx.xml
  cargo xtask generate-tags    # regenerates tags.tsv

